WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.840
Weak encryption matters because applications often enforce identity, access,

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.580
data handling, business workflows, and service integrations.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.800
Teams should evaluate this issue across user-facing features, APIs, administrative tools,

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.740
cloud services, and delivery pipelines.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:23.800
Missing TLS matters because applications often enforce identity, access, data handling,

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:26.660
business workflows, and service integrations.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.760
Poor key management matters because applications often enforce identity, access,

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.340
data handling, business workflows, and service integrations.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:41.000
Sensitive data exposure matters because applications often enforce identity, access,

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:45.300
data handling, business workflows, and service integrations.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:50.400
Strong cryptography Secure TLS configuration Secure key management Selected CIS Controls

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:54.380
mappings for this topic include Control 3 - Data Protection;

00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:02.040
3.10 - Encrypt sensitive data in transit; 3.11 - Encrypt sensitive data at rest.
